config BR2_PACKAGE_VYRO_INIT
    bool "vyro-init"
    help
      Vyro PID 1 — minimal service supervisor for Path B.

      Mounts /proc, /sys, /dev, /run, /tmp; starts udev for device nodes;
      reaps zombies; launches vyro-compositor as the foreground service.

      Not a systemd replacement for general Linux use — just enough to
      bring up the Vyro desktop.

      https://github.com/Gaurav06120714/VyroOs
